That happens will you resize it slowly.\n\nI can notice the same problem on windows with resizing, not just wayland, I'll try to fix this issue too in the same PR","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4207872405/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4208873081","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118289#issuecomment-4208873081","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118289","id":4208873081,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc763k55","user":{"login":"Infiland","id":88491175,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4NDkxMTc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/88491175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland","html_url":"https://github.com/Infiland","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-08T19:02:50Z","updated_at":"2026-04-08T19:02:50Z","body":"> The window resizes normally, and the bug is still fixed. Still, an extra review from someone who actually understands Wayland code is recommended.\r\n> \r\n> One odd thing is that I'm now having trouble attempting to replicate the original bug on `master`, weird.\r\n\r\nYeah I think we'll need more reviewers for this\r\n\r\nI'm not sure if I should make a fix for resizing where the embedded window flickers on Wayland upon resizing from the top or from the left side. Bottom and right seem to be good and there's no such issues on Windows.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4208873081/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4210760253","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118289#issuecomment-4210760253","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118289","id":4210760253,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc76-xo9","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-09T01:06:35Z","updated_at":"2026-04-09T01:06:35Z","body":"Hi, I haven't had much time to look into this issue properly so sorry if I misunderstand something.\r\n\r\nI can't replicate this on sway in my current build (ee713ccb7cbaddf59f8258ed6663461779d00856 with a random patch on top), so I guess that there might be some compositor-specific business going on.\r\n\r\nOne thing I'm not sure I understand: if the embedded client loses a connection to the display as you say it should crash which, while not ideal, should stop the process, so I'm kinda surprised that it holds on.\r\n\r\nMy hunch is that this can (and probably should) be fixed inside the Wayland embedder itself, instead of working around it. If the issue is that a close request sent to a window doesn't propagate to the embedded window, that shouldn't take much at all to fix directly at the source.\r\n\r\nPersonally I think that it'd be best to hold this PR until I can take a deeper look a it, as I think that we can get away with a simpler fix.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4210760253/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4537261410","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118289#issuecomment-4537261410","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118289","id":4537261410,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDnEdYg","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-25T21:11:38Z","updated_at":"2026-05-25T21:11:38Z","body":"Hi, I've investigated the issue, please see my report here: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114975#issuecomment-4536335392\r\n\r\nFrom my understanding, the root cause doesn't seem related to the order in which we do stuff, as the close request is actually sent, just not processed. The more likely cause seems to be a compositor issue, but we're still awaiting confirmation on that.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4537261410/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4581142198","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118289#issuecomment-4581142198","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118289","id":4581142198,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEQ6utg","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-30T01:29:44Z","updated_at":"2026-05-30T01:29:44Z","body":"The issue was indeed a kwin bug, and has been fixed upstream, so hopefully we're good here :D\r\n\r\nAs usual I've written more info in the related issue: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114975#issuecomment-4581091218 .\r\n\r\nI'll close this PR. Thank you for your contribution nonetheless!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4581142198/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]